<title>UK: LIFFE coffee, cocoa, sugar lower.</title>
<headline>LIFFE coffee, cocoa, sugar lower.</headline>
<text>
<p>COCOA - Eases but stays in tight range. May seven sterling lower at 1,005 stg at 0930 GMT</p>
<p>COFFEE - Gaps lower as expected. But volume small in slow start to the week. May $19 lower at $1,545</p>
<p>SUGAR - Corrects lower as May open interest declines before expiry. Spread narrows further. May $1.10 lower at $310.70.</p>
</text>
